# --- seo:canonical-host (one-hop consolidation) ---
# Netlify's default chain is http://www -> https://www -> https://apex, which is two
# hops. Google follows it, but consolidates slower across an extra hop. These rules
# send every host variant straight to the apex in a single 301.
http://www.flourish-counseling.co/*   https://flourish-counseling.co/:splat  301!
https://www.flourish-counseling.co/*  https://flourish-counseling.co/:splat  301!
http://flourish-counseling.co/*       https://flourish-counseling.co/:splat  301!
# --- /seo:canonical-host ---

